rse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:8.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:8.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja459:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja459:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja459:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja459:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja459:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja459:14.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:14.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:14.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja459:14.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja459:15.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja459:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja459:0.2": "Ekādasakanipāta ", "ja459:0.3": "Mātuposakavagga ", "ja459:0.4": "5. Pānīyajātaka ", "ja459:1.1": "“Mitto mittassa pānīyaṁ, ", "ja459:1.2": "adinnaṁ paribhuñjisaṁ; ", "ja459:1.3": "Tena pacchā vijigucchiṁ, ", "ja459:1.4": "taṁ pāpaṁ pakataṁ mayā; ", "ja459:1.5": "Mā puna akaraṁ pāpaṁ, ", "ja459:1.6": "tasmā pabbajito ahaṁ. ", "ja459:2.1": "Paradārañca disvāna, ", "ja459:2.2": "chando me udapajjatha; ", "ja459:2.3": "Tena pacchā vijigucchiṁ, ", "ja459:2.4": "taṁ pāpaṁ pakataṁ mayā; ", "ja459:2.5": "Mā puna akaraṁ pāpaṁ, ", "ja459:2.6": "tasmā pabbajito ahaṁ. ", "ja459:3.1": "Pitaraṁ me mahārāja, ", "ja459:3.2": "corā agaṇhu kānane; ", "ja459:3.3": "Tesāhaṁ pucchito jānaṁ, ", "ja459:3.4": "aññathā naṁ viyākariṁ. ", "ja459:4.1": "Tena pacchā vijigucchiṁ, ", "ja459:4.2": "taṁ pāpaṁ pakataṁ mayā; ", "ja459:4.3": "Mā puna akaraṁ pāpaṁ, ", "ja459:4.4": "tasmā pabbajito ahaṁ. ", "ja459:5.1": "Pāṇātipātamakaruṁ, ", "ja459:5.2": "somayāge upaṭṭhite; ", "ja459:5.3": "Tesāhaṁ samanuññāsiṁ. ", "ja459:6.1": "Tena pacchā vijigucchiṁ, ", "ja459:6.2": "taṁ pāpaṁ pakataṁ mayā; ", "ja459:6.3": "Mā puna akaraṁ pāpaṁ, ", "ja459:6.4": "tasmā pabbajito ahaṁ. ", "ja459:7.1": "Surāmerayamādhukā, ", "ja459:7.2": "ye janā paṭhamāsu no; ", "ja459:7.3": "Bahūnaṁ te anatthāya, ", "ja459:7.4": "majjapānamakappayuṁ; ", "ja459:7.5": "Tesāhaṁ samanuññāsiṁ. ", "ja459:8.1": "Tena pacchā vijigucchiṁ, ", "ja459:8.2": "taṁ pāpaṁ pakataṁ mayā; ", "ja459:8.3": "Mā puna akaraṁ pāpaṁ, ", "ja459:8.4": "tasmā pabbajito ahaṁ”. ", "ja459:9.1": "“Dhiratthu subahū kāme, ", "ja459:9.2": "duggandhe bahukaṇṭake; ", "ja459:9.3": "Ye ahaṁ paṭisevanto, ", "ja459:9.4": "nālabhiṁ tādisaṁ sukhaṁ”. ", "ja459:10.1": "“Mahassādā sukhā kāmā, ", "ja459:10.2": "Natthi kāmā paraṁ sukhaṁ; ", "ja459:10.3": "Ye kāme paṭisevanti, ", "ja459:10.4": "Saggaṁ te upapajjare”. ", "ja459:11.1": "“Appassādā dukhā kāmā, ", "ja459:11.2": "natthi kāmā paraṁ dukhaṁ; ", "ja459:11.3": "Ye kāme paṭisevanti, ", "ja459:11.4": "nirayaṁ te upapajjare. ", "ja459:12.1": "Asī yathā sunisito, ", "ja459:12.2": "nettiṁsova supāyiko; ", "ja459:12.3": "Sattīva urasi khittā, ", "ja459:12.4": "kāmā dukkhatarā tato. ", "ja459:13.1": "Aṅgārānaṁva jalitaṁ, ", "ja459:13.2": "kāsuṁ sādhikaporisaṁ; ", "ja459:13.3": "Phālaṁva divasantattaṁ, ", "ja459:13.4": "kāmā dukkhatarā tato. ", "ja459:14.1": "Visaṁ yathā halāhalaṁ, ", "ja459:14.2": "telaṁ pakkuthitaṁ yathā; ", "ja459:14.3": "Tambaloha vilīnaṁva, ", "ja459:14.4": "kāmā dukkhatarā tato”ti. ", "ja459:15.1": "Pānīyajātakaṁ pañcamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja459:0.1": "", "ja459:0.2": "", "ja459:0.3": "", "ja459:0.4": "", "ja459:1.1": "", "ja459:1.2": "", "ja459:1.3": "", "ja459:1.4": "", "ja459:1.5": "", "ja459:1.6": "", "ja459:2.1": "", "ja459:2.2": "udapajjatha → upapajjatha (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja459:2.3": "", "ja459:2.4": "", "ja459:2.5": "", "ja459:2.6": "", "ja459:3.1": "", "ja459:3.2": "agaṇhu → agaṇhuṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); aggaṇhu (sya1ed, sya2ed); agaṇhi (mr) ", "ja459:3.3": "", "ja459:3.4": "", "ja459:4.1": "", "ja459:4.2": "", "ja459:4.3": "", "ja459:4.4": "", "ja459:5.1": "", "ja459:5.2": "", "ja459:5.3": "", "ja459:6.1": "", "ja459:6.2": "", "ja459:6.3": "", "ja459:6.4": "", "ja459:7.1": "Surāmerayamādhukā → … madhukā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja459:7.2": "", "ja459:7.3": "", "ja459:7.4": "", "ja459:7.5": "", "ja459:8.1": "", "ja459:8.2": "", "ja459:8.3": "", "ja459:8.4": "", "ja459:9.1": "", "ja459:9.2": "", "ja459:9.3": "", "ja459:9.4": "", "ja459:10.1": "", "ja459:10.2": "paraṁ → kāmaparaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja459:10.3": "", "ja459:10.4": "", "ja459:11.1": "", "ja459:11.2": "", "ja459:11.3": "", "ja459:11.4": "", "ja459:12.1": "", "ja459:12.2": "supāyiko → supāyito (mr) ", "ja459:12.3": "", "ja459:12.4": "", "ja459:13.1": "", "ja459:13.2": "", "ja459:13.3": "", "ja459:13.4": "", "ja459:14.1": "", "ja459:14.2": "telaṁ pakkuthitaṁ → telamukkaṭṭhitaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); telaṁ pakkuṭṭhitaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja459:14.3": "Tambaloha → tambalohaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja459:14.4": "", "ja459:15.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja459:0.1": "", "ja459:0.2": "", "ja459:0.3": "", "ja459:0.4": "", "ja459:1.1": "ms22J_2169, msdiv59, pts-vp-pli4.116, sya27.314", "ja459:1.2": "", "ja459:1.3": "", "ja459:1.4": "", "ja459:1.5": "", "ja459:1.6": "", "ja459:2.1": "dr27.312, ms22J_2170, msdiv60", "ja459:2.2": "", "ja459:2.3": "", "ja459:2.4": "", "ja459:2.5": "", "ja459:2.6": "", "ja459:3.1": "ms22J_2171, msdiv61, vri68.183", "